# Next.js

One route per `catalog/screens.json` id. Tokens from the demo HTML. Do not restyle `empty` screens against invented UI. Do not invent a 48th screen. Exam-prep navigation omits `staff-login`. Local data is FastAPI + Compose Postgres (README §1), not HTML files.

See README §3 and `frontend/CLAUDE.md`.
